        "description_short": "Remove all the arrows from the six-sided cube!",
        "description_excerpt": "Welcome to *CubeAway - 3DPuzzle*.<br>Featuring a simple yet beautiful design, this logic puzzle game will test your thinking skills, concentration, and creativity.<br>Carefully navigate the intricately intertwined maze of arrows and remove them all without making a single mistake.<br>Each stage presents a unique challenge that combines logical thinking, timing, and spatial awareness.<br><br>Enjoy a rewarding puzzle experience that requires both intuition and strategic thinking.<br><br>The goal is simple, but you must never let your guard down.<br>Remove the arrows in the correct order to clear them all from the cube.<br>Anticipate your next move, visualize chain reactions, and discover the optimal sequence.<br><br>Whether you’re a puzzle veteran or a beginner,<br>“CubeAway - 3DPuzzle” delivers two distinct pleasures: the joy of thinking and a sense of calm tranquility.<br><br>Each puzzle is a story that demands logic, patience, and precision.<br>Can you remove all the arrows placed on the six sides?<br><br>Test your mental agility in a quiet, beautiful world.<br>“CubeAway - 3DPuzzle” will become your new “healing time for the mind.”",
